.DS_Store
node_modules/
dist/
!docs/site/vendor/
!docs/site/vendor/image-size/
!docs/site/vendor/image-size/dist/
!docs/site/vendor/image-size/dist/**
build/
coverage/
reports/
# `reports/` ignora saídas de ferramenta em qualquer nível. Exceções rastreadas: os relatórios de
# worker de `work/rounds/*/reports/` (evidência versionada; R-0007 perdeu 24 relatórios, C-0002
# §4; R-0018 CTG-0002) e o código de aplicação `features/reports` (R-0016: o módulo do console —
# telas D-16/D-17 — ficou fora de um commit por causa dele).
!work/rounds/*/reports/
!work/rounds/*/reports/**
!apps/*/*/src/app/features/reports/
!apps/*/*/src/app/features/reports/**
tmp/
.turbo/
.vite/
.vite-temp/
.test-results/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets/

# Docusaurus site (Phase 6 consolidation) — synced tree and build outputs
docs/site/node_modules/
docs/site/build/
docs/site/.docusaurus/
docs/site/docs/
docs/site/static/docs-assets/

# Round/working artifacts are unpublished and untracked (teat/pec convention)
docs/work/**
!docs/work/devai/
!docs/work/devai/**

# DEVAI machine state: derived artifacts are ignored; evidence-chain.json is
# deliberately TRACKED (not ignored) — ADR-CI-ECONOMY Decision 1 requires
# evidence records committed with the PR so the reusable evidence gate can
# verify the Article 32 hash chain remotely.
.devai/state/sensor-readings/
.devai/state/sensors/
.devai/state/inventory/
.devai/state/mutation/
.devai/state/scorecards/
.devai/state/test-results/
.devai/state/coverage/
.devai/state/agent-runs/
.devai/state/skills/
.devai/state/health/
.devai/state/rtd/
.devai/state/rtd-manifests/
.devai/state/check-cache/
.devai/state/obligations.json
.devai/state/counters.json
.devai/state/init-introspection.json
.devai/state/docs-publish-baseline.txt
!.devai/state/.gitkeep
